"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Vast &amp; Vibrant Open World:\u00a0</strong>Tasneem is alive with wonders waiting to be discovered. Explore sunlit archipelagos, lush forests, ancient temples, and towering pillars, each with their own mysteries and history.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Uncover the Lost History of Tasneem:\u00a0</strong>The ruins whisper of a forgotten past, one that ties your empire to the very heart of Tasneem\u2019s suffering. Decipher ancient glyphs, uncover hidden temples, and piece together the truth of a world on the brink.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Aesthetic, Meditative Vibes:\u00a0</strong>SOAR is more than just an adventure, it\u2019s a wholesome, relaxing experience. Fly at your own pace, immerse yourself in the beauty of the world, and let your mind wander as you glide through the skies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play Your Own Way:\u00a0</strong>Whether you're looking for a peaceful escape or a high-speed thrill ride, SOAR adapts to your mood. Weave between islands in a flow state, race against time in speed trials, or simply glide across the horizon as the music carries you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An Immersive Soundscape:\u00a0</strong>Let the world pull you in with a stunning, dynamic soundtrack that ebbs and flows with your journey. Every moment in SOAR is accompanied by an enchanting atmosphere of music and sound.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1513030/extras/7220a9a989542084d9ce0e790183dfbd.poster.avif?t=1745895573\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1513030/extras/7220a9a989542084d9ce0e790183dfbd.webm?t=1745895573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1513030/extras/7220a9a989542084d9ce0e790183dfbd.mp4?t=1745895573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1513030/extras/9346487743e482683bd07522f1037581.avif?t=1745895573\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Had a stressful day? Let the wind guide you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Looking for a challenge? Push your flight to the limit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Need something to pair with a podcast? Enjoy effortless, beautiful exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>SOAR: Pillars of Tasneem</i>, the sky is not just a setting: it\u2019s a feeling, a journey, and a world waiting to be discovered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Add <i>SOAR: Pillars of Tasneem</i> to your wishlist and prepare to take flight!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1513030/extras/7e0568b057b22e1cefd8f2d300b85414.avif?t=1745895573\" data-has-big /></div></p>",
